diff --git a/qbitx-gui/docs/build-windows.md b/qbitx-gui/docs/build-windows.md
index 4140def..906aaf8 100644
--- a/qbitx-gui/docs/build-windows.md
+++ b/qbitx-gui/docs/build-windows.md
@@ -56,3 +56,22 @@ Set before running the script or cmake:
 
 - `QT_MINGW` / `Qt6_DIR`: Qt for MinGW (target).
 - `QT_HOST` / `QT_HOST_PATH`: Qt for host (moc, rcc, uic).
+
+## Core 0.4.0 bundle and installer
+
+The bundle requires the official `qbitx-v0.4.0-windows.zip` archive and checks its
+published SHA-256. Missing or mismatched Core binaries must not be packaged.
+
+```bash
+CORE_ARCHIVE=/path/to/qbitx-v0.4.0-windows.zip ./scripts/bundle-win.sh
+```
+
+Compile `installer/qbitx-wallet.iss` using Inno Setup 6 on Windows. The destination
+page is always shown, including upgrades. Node and CLI binaries live beside
+`qbitx-gui.exe`; automatic CLI detection follows the current application folder.
+An explicit manual CLI path remains supported. Wallet/blockchain data stays in
+the existing data directory when changing the installation destination.
+
+Before distributing, check installation and upgrade to a custom path containing
+spaces, launch/close, CLI version 0.4.0, and a send on a disposable test wallet.
+After an ambiguous send failure, check history before retrying.
